OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMainly dry and cloudy, some
OL,6,Fbrighter spells possible along in the
OL,7,Feast. Rain will spread east later in
OL,8,Fthe afternoon. Warm in any brightness
OL,9,Fin the east.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloudy as outbreaks of rain
OL,12,Fspread east through the evening and
OL,13,Fovernight, rain becoming heavy at
OL,14,Ftimes. Becoming mainly dry by morning
OL,15,Fwith just a few showers remaining.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FBright spells and some
OL,18,Fshowers through the day, some turning
OL,19,Fheavy and thundery in the afternoon
OL,20,Fand early evening. Best of the dry,
OL,21,Fbright weather in the east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
